=== hello world
print("hello, world")
--- stdout
hello, world

=== line and block comments
// a comment
print(1) // trailing
/* block
   /* nested */ still comment */
print(2)
--- stdout
1
2

=== doc comments are ignored at runtime
/// Adds one.
fn inc(x: int) -> int { x + 1 }
print(inc(1))
--- stdout
2

